{"key": "bk2:LIBRARY_0", "game": "bk2", "source_file": "a8cc32bba98258300a54327273719c75.bundle#TextData_en", "text_id": "LIBRARY_0", "id_index": 4617, "category": "dialogue", "form": "line", "flags": [], "scene_id": "bk2:LIBRARY#00", "batch_id": "bk2:B0158", "order": 0, "global_order": 8850, "prev_key": null, "next_key": "bk2:LIBRARY_1", "en_sha1": "dc565b71638b1c88baf9867564635eaf94f5e1e2", "dedup_group": "bk2:en#4496", "dedup_size": 1, "tags": ["<w>", "<p>", "<w>", "<p>", "<w>", "<p>", "<w>", "<p>", "<w>", "<p>", "<w>"], "variant": null, "speaker": {"id": "NPCName_295", "status": "confirmed_data", "source": "auto", "candidates": [], "gender_evidence": {"verdict": "none", "m": 0.0, "f": 0.0}, "style": [], "script": {"status": "name_tag", "names": [{"id": "NPCName_295", "en": "Librarian", "calls": 1}], "no_tag_calls": 0, "dynamic_calls": 0}, "name_tag": {"id": "NPCName_295", "en": "Librarian"}, "basis": "табличка имени в скрипте игры (_SetNameTag)"}, "speaker_gender": "unknown", "addressee": {"id": "unknown", "status": "unknown", "candidates": []}, "addressee_gender": "unknown", "register": "unknown", "context": "", "ru": "Э-это книги по истории, читатели которых неизвестны, а это невозвращённые... так.<w><p>Нет, стоп! Погодите! Разве здесь не лежали ярлыки для неопознанных томов по географии?!<w><p>Ааа!\nУ меня всё в голове перепуталось!<w><p>Мозги мои спутались, путаные мои мозги!\nЯ запутанно пере... перепу...<w><p>Ух! Это никогда не КОНЧИТСЯ!<w><p>Как они думают, я в одиночку наведу порядок в стольких книгах?! Всё, сдаюсь! Я ухожу!<w>", "status": "edited", "qa_flags": [], "translator_note": "игра слов discombobulated/bobbles disco передана приблизительно", "editor_note": "игра слов (discombobulated/disco) передана приблизительно", "history": [{"ts": "2026-10-20T01:15:14", "actor": "translator/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "translator", "run": "runs/20261020/bk2_B0158_translator_011514.json"}, {"ts": "2026-10-20T01:15:19", "actor": "qa/local", "action": "qa_pass"}, {"ts": "2026-10-20T02:13:11", "actor": "editor/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "editor", "run": "runs/20261020/bk2_B0158_editor_021311.json"}]}
{"key": "bk2:LIBRARY_1", "game": "bk2", "source_file": "a8cc32bba98258300a54327273719c75.bundle#TextData_en", "text_id": "LIBRARY_1", "id_index": 4618, "category": "dialogue", "form": "line", "flags": [], "scene_id": "bk2:LIBRARY#00", "batch_id": "bk2:B0158", "order": 1, "global_order": 8851, "prev_key": "bk2:LIBRARY_0", "next_key": "bk2:LIBRARY_2", "en_sha1": "41978e205af6a43d2d2005890e10752f14fef877", "dedup_group": "bk2:en#4497", "dedup_size": 1, "tags": ["<w300>", "<w300>", "<w300>", "<w>", "<p>", "<w300>", "<w>", "<p>", "<w300>", "<w>"], "variant": null, "speaker": {"id": "NPCName_295", "status": "confirmed_data", "source": "auto", "candidates": [], "gender_evidence": {"verdict": "none", "m": 0.0, "f": 0.0}, "style": [], "script": {"status": "name_tag", "names": [{"id": "NPCName_295", "en": "Librarian", "calls": 1}], "no_tag_calls": 0, "dynamic_calls": 0}, "name_tag": {"id": "NPCName_295", "en": "Librarian"}, "basis": "табличка имени в скрипте игры (_SetNameTag)"}, "speaker_gender": "unknown", "addressee": {"id": "unknown", "status": "unknown", "candidates": []}, "addressee_gender": "unknown", "register": "unknown", "context": "", "ru": "Вооот тут...<w300> фи-ЛО-софия!<w300>\nА вооот тут...<w300> ИС-тория!<w><p>А это...<w300>\nтом, который раньше затерялся!<w><p>А ЭТОТ...<w300>\nтот, что туда не влез!\nХи-хи, ура-а!<w>", "status": "edited", "qa_flags": [], "translator_note": "", "editor_note": "", "history": [{"ts": "2026-10-20T01:15:14", "actor": "translator/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "translator", "run": "runs/20261020/bk2_B0158_translator_011514.json"}, {"ts": "2026-10-20T01:15:19", "actor": "qa/local", "action": "qa_pass"}, {"ts": "2026-10-20T02:13:11", "actor": "editor/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "editor", "run": "runs/20261020/bk2_B0158_editor_021311.json"}, {"ts": "2026-10-20T05:00:29", "actor": "editor/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "editor", "run": "runs/20261020/bk2_B0158_editor_050029.json"}]}
{"key": "bk2:LIBRARY_2", "game": "bk2", "source_file": "a8cc32bba98258300a54327273719c75.bundle#TextData_en", "text_id": "LIBRARY_2", "id_index": 4619, "category": "dialogue", "form": "line", "flags": [], "scene_id": "bk2:LIBRARY#00", "batch_id": "bk2:B0158", "order": 2, "global_order": 8852, "prev_key": "bk2:LIBRARY_1", "next_key": "bk2:LIBRARY_3", "en_sha1": "3e72fb62e43c27ef21caa2ac36826a4dcbcb8410", "dedup_group": "bk2:en#4498", "dedup_size": 1, "tags": ["<w>", "<p>", "<w>", "<p>", "<w>", "<p>", "<w>", "<p>", "<w500>", "<w500>", "<w>"], "variant": null, "speaker": {"id": "NPCName_295", "status": "confirmed_data", "source": "auto", "candidates": [], "gender_evidence": {"verdict": "m", "m": 0.9, "f": 0}, "style": [], "script": {"status": "name_tag", "names": [{"id": "NPCName_295", "en": "Librarian", "calls": 1}], "no_tag_calls": 0, "dynamic_calls": 0}, "name_tag": {"id": "NPCName_295", "en": "Librarian"}, "basis": "табличка имени в скрипте игры (_SetNameTag)"}, "speaker_gender": "unknown", "addressee": {"id": "unknown", "status": "unknown", "candidates": []}, "addressee_gender": "unknown", "register": "unknown", "context": "", "ru": "Эй, вы меня слушаете?! Мне когда-нибудь одолеть столько материалов?! Ух!<w><p>Я тут загоняю себя работой всё это время! Ух!\nНи минуты не бездельничаю! Ух!<w><p>Как вы думаете, сколько я уже не появляюсь дома из-за работы, которую на меня вечно сваливают? А?!<w><p>А одно слово сверху — и весь мой труд насмарку?!<w><p>Абу! Бу, бубубу!<w500>\nВсё кончено! Так не бывает!\nЭтот разговор. Окончен.<w500> ВСЁ!<w>", "status": "edited", "qa_flags": [], "translator_note": "", "editor_note": "", "history": [{"ts": "2026-10-20T01:15:14", "actor": "translator/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "translator", "run": "runs/20261020/bk2_B0158_translator_011514.json"}, {"ts": "2026-10-20T01:15:19", "actor": "qa/local", "action": "qa_pass"}, {"ts": "2026-10-20T02:13:11", "actor": "editor/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "editor", "run": "runs/20261020/bk2_B0158_editor_021311.json"}]}
{"key": "bk2:LIBRARY_3", "game": "bk2", "source_file": "a8cc32bba98258300a54327273719c75.bundle#TextData_en", "text_id": "LIBRARY_3", "id_index": 4620, "category": "dialogue", "form": "line", "flags": [], "scene_id": "bk2:LIBRARY#00", "batch_id": "bk2:B0158", "order": 3, "global_order": 8853, "prev_key": "bk2:LIBRARY_2", "next_key": "bk2:LIBRARY_4", "en_sha1": "c4db65f8ea2c5f816c09b27c8bbfe4168c829ff1", "dedup_group": "bk2:en#4499", "dedup_size": 1, "tags": ["<w>"], "variant": null, "speaker": {"id": "NPCName_295", "status": "confirmed_data", "source": "auto", "candidates": [], "gender_evidence": {"verdict": "none", "m": 0.0, "f": 0.0}, "style": [], "script": {"status": "name_tag", "names": [{"id": "NPCName_295", "en": "Librarian", "calls": 2}], "no_tag_calls": 0, "dynamic_calls": 0}, "name_tag": {"id": "NPCName_295", "en": "Librarian"}, "basis": "табличка имени в скрипте игры (_SetNameTag)"}, "speaker_gender": "unknown", "addressee": {"id": "unknown", "status": "unknown", "candidates": []}, "addressee_gender": "unknown", "register": "unknown", "context": "", "ru": "Фух, мне гораздо лучше.\nКак же полегчало, когда всё это выплеснулось! Я как на крыльях!<w>", "status": "edited", "qa_flags": [], "translator_note": "", "editor_note": "", "history": [{"ts": "2026-10-20T01:15:14", "actor": "translator/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "translator", "run": "runs/20261020/bk2_B0158_translator_011514.json"}, {"ts": "2026-10-20T01:15:19", "actor": "qa/local", "action": "qa_pass"}, {"ts": "2026-10-20T02:13:11", "actor": "editor/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "editor", "run": "runs/20261020/bk2_B0158_editor_021311.json"}]}
{"key": "bk2:LIBRARY_4", "game": "bk2", "source_file": "a8cc32bba98258300a54327273719c75.bundle#TextData_en", "text_id": "LIBRARY_4", "id_index": 4621, "category": "dialogue", "form": "line", "flags": [], "scene_id": "bk2:LIBRARY#00", "batch_id": "bk2:B0158", "order": 4, "global_order": 8854, "prev_key": "bk2:LIBRARY_3", "next_key": "bk2:LIBRARY_5", "en_sha1": "6bd2948306e89fa36069bb3fff77205c348522b8", "dedup_group": "bk2:en#4500", "dedup_size": 1, "tags": ["<w>"], "variant": null, "speaker": {"id": "NPCName_295", "status": "confirmed_data", "source": "auto", "candidates": [], "gender_evidence": {"verdict": "none", "m": 0.0, "f": 0.0}, "style": [], "script": {"status": "name_tag", "names": [{"id": "NPCName_295", "en": "Librarian", "calls": 2}], "no_tag_calls": 0, "dynamic_calls": 0}, "name_tag": {"id": "NPCName_295", "en": "Librarian"}, "basis": "табличка имени в скрипте игры (_SetNameTag)"}, "speaker_gender": "unknown", "addressee": {"id": "unknown", "status": "unknown", "candidates": []}, "addressee_gender": "unknown", "register": "unknown", "context": "", "ru": "Раз мне так хорошо, по секрету кое-что расскажу.<w>", "status": "edited", "qa_flags": [], "translator_note": "", "editor_note": "", "history": [{"ts": "2026-10-20T01:15:14", "actor": "translator/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "translator", "run": "runs/20261020/bk2_B0158_translator_011514.json"}, {"ts": "2026-10-20T01:15:19", "actor": "qa/local", "action": "qa_pass"}, {"ts": "2026-10-20T02:13:11", "actor": "editor/claude-sonnet-5.5", "action": "editor", "run": "runs/20261020/bk2_B0158_editor_021311.json"}]}
